<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 571.85, up 3.30.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 296 to 222.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.07.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,494,500, compared with 18,428,190 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
